  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the fideua noodles and cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the thawed prawns and cook until they are pink and fully cooked.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice, smoked paprika, and salt.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
